{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa Has a Nightmare", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Slip, Slap, Slop", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 4, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > The Inner Mind > Hypnosis is Still a Mystery", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 8, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe  routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob04re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "sledgehammer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a heavy tool used for hitting large objects", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I was carrying a sledgehammer.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about dreams.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "slippers", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a pair of shoes worn inside to keep your feet warm", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm wearing slippers because my feet are cold.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "slippery", "type": "name"}, {"content": "when a surface is difficult to stand on because it is wet or too smooth", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I was walking down a slippery hill.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "slimy ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "feeling wet and sticky", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The surface felt slimy.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "slope", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a hill", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I was walking down a steep slope.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to slap", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to hit with an open hand", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I felt someone slap me on the back.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob04aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to slip", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to fall and slide", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I slipped down the hill.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob04aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Stressing New Information", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you want to stress new information, you use different intonation and stress on the \u201cnew\u201d word or idea.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You usually stress content words in a sentence. Content words are the words that carry the most meaning (nouns, verbs, adjectives, adverbs, etc.).</br>  When you want to introduce new information in a conversation, you can choose to put the stress and the intonation on the \u201cnew\u201d words. This helps the listener understand that you want to stress that word and that it is important.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at this simple conversation:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: I <span class=\"strong\">need</span> a <span class=\"strong\">pair</span> of <span class=\"strong\">shoes</span>.</br> <span class=\"strong\">Jason</span>: What <span class=\"strong\">kind</span> of shoes? (\u201ckind\u201d is the new information, \u201cshoes\u201d is the old)</br> <span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: <span class=\"strong\">Dress</span> shoes.</br> <span class=\"strong\">Jason</span>: Any <span class=\"strong\">color</span> of dress shoes?</br> <span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: <span class=\"strong\">Black</span> dress shoes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you stress these \u201cnew\u201d words, your voice will rise slightly (intonation). ", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Linking and Deletion With Superlatives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use a superlative adjective to express the highest  of a quality. You use a superlative adjective to talk about one thing or person in a group of things. You always use <span class=\"italic\">the </span>with the superlative.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "In natural conversation, it is common to link and delete some sounds in the superlative adjective if there is a similar sound in the next word. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:</p> The strangest story.</br>  You delete the \u2018t' sound and link the \u2018s' sound. </br>The stranges_story.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Sometimes this makes it hard to listen to native speakers talk. If you know the rule, you can listen better. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice reading these words aloud:</p> The smallest sweater  =  The smalles_sweater </br> The loudest truck = The loudes_truck", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "With a partner, write down 10 words that start with sl.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a dialogue about a dream using these words.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice reading the dialogue aloud, practicing the sl sound.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write down 10 words that start with sl.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a dialogue with my partner about dreams using the words that start with sl.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "My partner and I practice the dialogue.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le08ob04re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le08ob04re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: How have you been sleeping since we talked about it?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, I've been slowly trying to increase the number of hours I sleep each night. The other night I had a really strange dream. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You mean like a nightmare?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Not a nightmare, per se ... but it was very surreal. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Tell me about it!"}, {"image": "engenn6le08ob04re2img05.jpg", "time": "19000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, I was carrying a sledgehammer and wearing slippers. I was walking down a slippery slope somewhere familiar. I felt someone slap me on the back and then I slipped and rolled down the hill. I thought I was going to hurt myself, but then I fell into a soft, fluffy white cloud. I felt something slimy on my face and when I woke up it was my cat Ninja licking my face! </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Wow ... that is the strangest story I've ever heard!"}, {"image": "engenn6le08ob04re2img05.jpg", "time": "51000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah, definitely the weirdest time I've had sleeping in a while ... I don't know if that's a good thing or a bad thing.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Try to be optimistic! Maybe it's a sign ...</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: A sign of what?"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le08ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le08ob04re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content"